格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Nix-native packaging for DeepSeek Harness (dsh)","id":"gh:1333312916","install_available":false,"language":"Nix","name":"dsh-nix","slug":"Samuka007/dsh-nix","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Nix-native packaging for DeepSeek Harness (dsh)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-nix"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Nix-native packaging for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`):"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"1. **`pkgs.dsh`** — the CLI as a reproducible Nix package (pnpm monorepo build,\nupstream pinned at `"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"47f9438`).\n2. **Profile packager** — compose DSH profiles from three kinds of plugins in\none ordered"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" list, with build-time resolution instead of `dsh plugin`'s\nactivation-time pnpm reconcile.\n3. **`pr"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"ograms.dsh` Home Manager module** — declarative plugin management in\nthe Thunderbird style: the modu"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"le owns the composition under `~/.dsh`,\nthe app owns its data."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Plugin model"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"A profile's `plugins` list accepts three kinds, mixed in any order:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Kind | Example | Resolution |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| in-box bundle | `\"@deepseek-ai/dsh-base\"` | name only; resolved from the `dsh` installation |\n| pn"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"pm spec | `\"github:someone/plugin\"` | fixed-output derivation runs `pnpm add` at build time; pin wit"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"h `specsHash` |\n| Nix package/path | `pkgs.fetchFromGitHub { ... }` or `./my-plugin` | symlinked int"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"o the profile; carries its own dependency closure |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Layer registration (which plugins join `dsh.profile.bundles`) is a pure\nbuild-time reconcile that re"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ads each resolved package's `dsh.bundle.patch`\ndeclaration — `dsh plugin`'s install/resolve/reconcil"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"e is replaced wholesale,\nso removal is declarative and resolution failures surface at `nix build`."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"In-box profiles get a **build-time boot check**: `checks.profile-boot-web`\nand `checks.profile-boot-"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"headless` boot the composed profile with dsh's own\n`boot()` (which runs `assertEntriesActivated`) in"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"side the Nix sandbox and\ndispose immediately. A profile that would fail at runtime — missing\nservice"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"s, failed activation — fails `nix build` instead. The check is the\nreal dsh fail-loud, not a reimple"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"mentation: `scripts/check-profile.mjs`\nloads the profile exactly as `dsh --profile` would and lets d"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"sh's own\naudit decide. `checks.profile-boot-web-nobase` proves the check catches a\nweb-app-without-b"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ase composition (8 pending entries)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Overlay"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The Home Manager module's `package` option defaults to `pkgs.dsh` when the\noverlay is applied, falli"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ng back to a self-contained `callPackage` build."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Home Manager"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Activation materialises each immutable profile into\n`~/.dsh/profiles/<name>` (stamp-based idempotent"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" refresh). The module owns\nonly the composition layers; sessions, settings, and credentials under\n`~"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"/.dsh` remain the app's."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Standalone"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The package also ships `dsh-acp-demo`, the ACP automation server app\n(JSON-RPC over stdio; supply a "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"leaf `cordis.yml` via `--config`, e.g. the\nupstream `examples/acp-agent/cordis.yml`)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Verification"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Real agent runs need credentials (`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`, or configure the model\nin the web UI so `~/.ds"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"h/.credentials.yaml` is populated)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Notes"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- The Home Manager module's default `package` builds `pkgs/dsh.nix` against\nyour nixpkgs, which must"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" provide `fetchPnpmDeps` and `pnpmConfigHook`.\n- Spec-string plugins change their resolved content o"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"nly when their\n`specsHash` is updated — deliberate lockfile-style ceremony.\n- Upstream `dsh` ships n"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"o TUI surface (only `web` and `headless` profiles);\na third-party TUI bundle would slot in as one pl"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"ce (only `web` and `headless` profiles);\na third-party TUI bundle would slot in as one plugin entry."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

